---
// Decorative "//" separator used between inline meta items across the site.
// Deliberately has no font-size of its own so it inherits the surrounding
// text size and always matches its neighbours. Decorative, so hidden from
// assistive tech and excluded from text selection.
---

<span
  aria-hidden="true"
  class="font-mono text-tertiary tracking-[-0.2em] select-none"
>//</span>
